@page "/docs/components/accordion"

<DocsPage Title="Accordion" Description="A vertically stacked set of interactive headings that each reveal a section of content.">
    <ComponentPreview Name="accordion-demo" Align="start" PreviewClass="*:data-[slot=accordion]:max-w-sm min-h-[300px]" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Installation" />
    <InstallationTabs Name="accordion" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Usage" />
    <CodeFigure Code="@UsageCode" LineNumbers="true" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Composition" />
    <p>Use the following composition to build an <code>Accordion</code>:</p>
    <CodeFigure Code="@CompositionCode" Language="text" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Basic" />
    <p>A basic accordion that shows one item at a time. The first item is open by default.</p>
    <ComponentPreview Name="accordion-basic" Align="start" PreviewClass="*:data-[slot=accordion]:max-w-sm min-h-[300px]" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Multiple" />
    <p>Use the <code>Multiple</code> parameter to allow multiple items to be open at the same time.</p>
    <ComponentPreview Name="accordion-multiple" Align="start" PreviewClass="*:data-[slot=accordion]:max-w-sm min-h-[450px]" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Disabled" />
    <p>Use the <code>Disabled</code> parameter on <code>AccordionItem</code> to disable individual items.</p>
    <ComponentPreview Name="accordion-disabled" Align="start" PreviewClass="*:data-[slot=accordion]:max-w-sm min-h-[300px]" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Borders" />
    <p>Add <code>border</code> to the <code>Accordion</code> and <code>border-b last:border-b-0</code> to the <code>AccordionItem</code> to add borders to the items.</p>
    <ComponentPreview Name="accordion-borders" Align="start" PreviewClass="*:data-[slot=accordion]:max-w-sm min-h-[300px]" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Card" />
    <p>Wrap the <code>Accordion</code> in a <code>Card</code> component.</p>
    <ComponentPreview Name="accordion-card" Align="start" PreviewClass="*:data-[slot=accordion]:max-w-sm min-h-[435px]" />
    <DocsHeading Title="RTL" />
    <p>To enable RTL support in Blazix, see the <a href="/docs/rtl">RTL configuration guide</a>.</p>
    <ComponentPreview Name="accordion-rtl" Direction="rtl" Align="start" PreviewClass="*:data-[slot=accordion]:max-w-sm min-h-[300px]" />
    <DocsHeading Title="API Reference" />
    <ApiReference Name="accordion" />
</DocsPage>

@code {
    private const string UsageCode = """
        <Accordion Value="@(["item-1"])">
            <AccordionItem Value="item-1">
                <AccordionTrigger>Is it accessible?</AccordionTrigger>
                <AccordionContent>Yes. It adheres to the WAI-ARIA design pattern.</AccordionContent>
            </AccordionItem>
        </Accordion>
        """;

    private const string CompositionCode = """
        Accordion
        ├── AccordionItem
        │   ├── AccordionTrigger
        │   └── AccordionContent
        └── AccordionItem
            ├── AccordionTrigger
            └── AccordionContent
        """;
}
